    "title": "Sharper observability signal and steadier release CI",
    "intro": "Today's nightly focused on the plumbing behind Aura's release pipeline: the desktop release workflow now produces a more honest health snapshot, CI gets safer defaults for service URLs, and artifact polling shrugs off transient GitHub API hiccups instead of failing the run.",
    "entries": [
      {
        "batch_id": "entry-1",
        "time_label": "12:10 AM",
